{"seq":7,"at":"2026-11-15T01:27:00.801Z","why":"F.1: the parts and ideas the levels unlock are parts.json pieces whose inside refers to the task that builds or teaches them; a building task gives its board's ports itself","by":"cli","ops":[{"op":"part.add","part":"counter","data":{"name":{"zh":"路线计数器"},"desc":{"zh":"把两条来路的数加起来；「起点」口是「是」时，再加 1。「—」不算在内，什么都没收到时输出「—」。"},"inside":[{"task":"stamp"}]}},{"op":"level.set","level":"stamp","path":["tasks",0,"ports"],"value":[{"way":{"n":1,"sensor":"up"}},{"way":{"n":2,"sensor":"left"}},{"start":{"sensor":"start"}}]},{"op":"level.unset","level":"stamp","path":"builds"},{"op":"level.unset","level":"stamp","path":"unlock"},{"op":"part.add","part":"order","data":{"name":{"zh":"填表顺序"},"desc":{"zh":"每个格子都要排在它要读的格子之后。顺序反过来，电路读的方向也得跟着反过来。"},"inside":[{"task":"order"}]}},{"op":"level.unset","level":"order","path":"unlock"},{"op":"part.add","part":"min","data":{"name":{"zh":"最省格"},"desc":{"zh":"取最多三条来路里最小的（「起点」口是「是」时，0 也算一条来路），再加上本格代价。来路全是「—」时，输出「—」。"},"inside":[{"task":"slantcost"}]}},{"op":"level.set","level":"slantcost","path":["tasks",0,"ports"],"value":[{"way":{"n":1,"sensor":"left"}},{"way":{"n":2,"sensor":"ul"}},{"start":{"sensor":"start"}},{"named":{"label":{"zh":"本格代价"},"short":{"zh":"价"},"sensor":"cost"}},{"way":{"n":3,"input":"way3"}}]},{"op":"level.unset","level":"slantcost","path":"builds"},{"op":"level.unset","level":"slantcost","path":"unlock"},{"op":"part.add","part":"layer","data":{"name":{"zh":"分层"},"desc":{"zh":"把表复制成几层，让状态多记一件会影响未来的事。"},"inside":[{"task":"robber_2"}]}},{"op":"level.unset","level":"robber","path":"unlock"},{"op":"part.add","part":"align","data":{"name":{"zh":"对齐表"},"desc":{"zh":"一个词放上面，一个词放左边。字相同，左上 + 1；否则取上面和左边中较大的。"},"inside":[{"task":"lcs"}]}},{"op":"level.unset","level":"lcs","path":"unlock"},{"op":"part.add","part":"cost","data":{"name":{"zh":"编辑距离器"},"desc":{"zh":"输出这几个数里最小的：上面、左边、左上三者中最小的 + 1；字相同时的左上；起点上的 0。"},"inside":[{"task":"edit"}]}},{"op":"level.set","level":"edit","path":["tasks",0,"port